msgstr "Eskane modèl figi"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Pa ka sove modèl figi"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Eskane dezyèm modèl"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Pa t 'kapab anrejistre dezyèm modèl la"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Premye modèl ou a sove, kidonk koneksyon figi deja ap travay. Asire w "
"ke figi ou byen limen ak santre, epi eseye ankò - oswa sote epi ajoute"
" yon modèl pita nan Anviwònman."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Ajoute yon modèl figi (obligatwa)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Konekte figi bezwen omwen yon modèl figi, kidonk eskanè sa a pa ka sot"
"e. Anrejistre li nan limyè ou konn chita a. Ekleraj chanje fason figi "
"ou gade nan kamera a, kidonk konsidere ajoute yon dezyèm modèl pita na"
"n Anviwònman, anrejistre nan diferan limyè (pa egzanp lanp aswè olye p"
"ou yo lajounen)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Ajoute yon dezyèm modèl figi (rekòmande)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Premye modèl ou a sove. Ekleraj chanje fason figi ou gade nan kamera a"
": yon modèl anrejistre nan lajounen ka echwe nan aswè a anba lanp (osw"
"a nan lòt fason), epi Ubuntu Hello Lè sa a, fwa soti olye pou yo deblo"
"ke. Yon dezyèm modèl ki anrejistre nan diferan limyè kenbe rekonesans "
"serye nan nenpòt ki lè nan jounen an."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Chanje ekleraj la an premye: chanje limyè chanm lan oswa lanp biwo lim"
"en oswa etenn, vire lwen fenèt la, oswa mete linèt yo pafwa mete yo. L"
"è sa a, gade tou dwat nan kamera a epi peze Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Enstalasyon"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyo"
"n figi (bous detekte: {}).\n\n<b>Estati TPM:</b> Tcheke pyès ki nan ko"
"npitè ak zouti TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyo"
"n figi (bous detekte: {}).\n\n<b>Estati TPM:</b> Materyèl TPM detekte."
" Enstale <i>tpm2-tools</i> otomatikman..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyo"
"n figi (bous detekte: {}).\n\n<b>Estati TPM:</b> Materyèl TPM 2.0 akti"
"f. Modpas ou a pral byen sele andedan TPM la."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyo"
"n figi (bous detekte: {}).\n\n<b>Estati TPM:</b> TPM pyès ki nan konpi"
"tè detekte, men enstalasyon otomatik <i>tpm2-tools</i> echwe. Kouri <c"
"ode>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Tonbe tounen nan lojisyèl ki b"
"aze sou kachèt kalifikasyon."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka debloke {} ou otomatikman lè l sèvi avèk otantifikasyo"
"n figi (bous detekte: {}).\n\n<b>Estati TPM:</b> Pa gen pyès ki nan ko"
"npitè TPM detekte. Sèvi ak kachèt kalifikasyon ki baze sou lojisyèl (A"
"ES-256-GCM)."

