msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Debloke"

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Pèmèt otantifikasyon figi pou déblotché otomatikman keyring w la oswa "
"KWallet lè w konekte. Sa a sere modpas ou sele nan TPM a lè li disponi"
"b, oswa ankode avèk AES-256-GCM lè l sèvi avèk yon kle prensipal rasin"
" sèlman. Ansanm otorizasyon figi PAM_AUTHTOK pou pam_gnome_keyring osw"
"a pam_kwallet5 selon Desktop ou."

